      }
    ]
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "give every player the same ten cards",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": [
              "cat_-8",
              "cat_-5",
              "cat_3",
              "cat_5",
              "cat_8",
              "cat_11",
              "cat_15",
              "rabbit",
              "large_dog",
              "small_dog"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "set one random card aside from each hand",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[0].hand[int(uniform(0, len(players[0].hand)))]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "set_aside",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 1"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[1].hand[int(uniform(0, len(players[1].hand)))]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "set_aside",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 2"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[2].hand[int(uniform(0, len(players[2].hand)))]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 3"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "set_aside",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 3"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 3"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[3].hand[int(uniform(0, len(players[3].hand)))]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "set_aside",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 4"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[4].hand[int(uniform(0, len(players[4].hand)))]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 5"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "set_aside",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 5"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 5"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "starting mice and cat points",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_mice"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "cat_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_cat_points"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "choose the first start player",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "start_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(len(players), 1 + int(uniform(0, len(players))))"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {start_seat} is the first start player."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "your starting state",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "mice",
        "cat_points"
      ],
      "text": "You start with:"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "sack",
      "label": "write a message",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "text"
      },
      "store": "message",
      "text": "Write one short message to the table, at most {message_max_words} words. It may claim anything and is not enforced. Nobody sees any message until everyone has written theirs."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "sack",
      "label": "put a card in the sack",
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "hand"
        }
      },
      "store": "played_card",
      "text": "Choose one card from your hand and place it face down in the sack. It leaves your hand. Nobody else sees your choice."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "sack",
      "label": "lay out the sack",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.played_card"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_owners",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.seat for p in players if p.seat >= start_seat] + [p.seat for p in players if p.seat < start_seat]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[p.played_card for p in players if p.seat >= start_seat] + [p.played_card for p in players if p.seat < start_seat]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "messages_shown",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[[p.seat, p.message] for p in players]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_revealed",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage_report",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "standing_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "initial_standing_bid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader_seat",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_value",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "in_auction",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round_number} of {rounds}. The sack is laid out; sack positions 1, 2, 3, ... belong to seats {sack_owners}, in that order."
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "sack",
      "label": "show the messages",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Messages this round [seat, message]: {messages_shown}"
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stage 1",
      "label": "reveal sack card 1",
      "do": [
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "sack_revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack_cards[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Stage 1: sack card 1 (seat {start_seat}'s card) is revealed: {sack_revealed}. The standing bid is {standing_bid} and there is no leader."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "stage 1",
      "label": "stage 1 bid",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.mice >= standing_bid + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": 0,
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.mice"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "text": "Stage 1. Revealed so far: {sack_revealed}. Write 0 to pass, or bid a whole number from the standing bid + 1 ({standing_bid} + 1) up to your mice. Any number at or below the standing bid counts as a pass."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stage 1",
      "label": "resolve stage 1",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.bid < standing_bid + 1 or you.bid > you.mice"
            },
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "all_pass_stage_1_reward"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_cards",
            "value": [],
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": 0,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            },
            "text": "Everyone passed at stage 1: every player gains {all_pass_stage_1_reward} mice, nobody takes the sack and it is discarded unopened."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.bid == 0"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pass_reward_stage_1"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.bid == 0"
            },
            "key": "in_auction",
            "value": false,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "standing_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid for p in players])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "([p.seat for p in players if p.seat > start_seat and p.bid == standing_bid] + [p.seat for p in players if p.seat <= start_seat and p.bid == standing_bid])[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_auction for p in players) == 1 and not sack_done"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_auction for p in players) == 1 and not sack_done"
            },
            "text": "Only one player is still in: seat {leader_seat} wins the sack at {standing_bid}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage_report",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[[p.seat, p.bid, p.mice] for p in players]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Stage 1 result [seat, bid (0 = pass), mice now]: {stage_report}. Standing bid {standing_bid}; leader seat {leader_seat} (0 = no leader)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stage 2",
      "label": "reveal sack card 2",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not sack_done and count(p.in_auction for p in players) >= 2"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage",
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "sack_revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack_cards[1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Stage 2: sack card 2 is revealed. Revealed so far, in sack order: {sack_revealed}. Standing bid {standing_bid}, leader seat {leader_seat}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "stage 2",
      "label": "stage 2 bid",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not sack_done and stage == 2"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.in_auction and you.mice >= standing_bid + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": 0,
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.mice"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "text": "Stage 2. Revealed so far: {sack_revealed}. Standing bid {standing_bid}, leader seat {leader_seat}. Write 0 to pass, or bid a whole number from the standing bid + 1 up to your mice. Any number at or below the standing bid counts as a pass."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stage 2",
      "label": "resolve stage 2",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not sack_done and stage == 2"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.bid < standing_bid + 1 or you.bid > you.mice"
            },
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.seat != leader_seat"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pass_reward_stage_2"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            },
            "text": "Everyone still in passed at stage 2: seat {leader_seat} takes the sack at {standing_bid} with no reward; every other passer gains {pass_reward_stage_2} mice."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.bid == 0"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pass_reward_stage_2"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.bid == 0"
            },
            "key": "in_auction",
            "value": false,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "standing_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid for p in players])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "([p.seat for p in players if p.seat > start_seat and p.bid == standing_bid] + [p.seat for p in players if p.seat <= start_seat and p.bid == standing_bid])[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_auction for p in players) == 1 and not sack_done"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_auction for p in players) == 1 and not sack_done"
            },
            "text": "Only one player is still in: seat {leader_seat} wins the sack at {standing_bid}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage_report",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[[p.seat, p.bid, p.mice] for p in players]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Stage 2 result [seat, bid (0 = pass), mice now]: {stage_report}. Standing bid {standing_bid}; leader seat {leader_seat}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stage 3",
      "label": "reveal sack card 3",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not sack_done and count(p.in_auction for p in players) >= 2"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage",
            "value": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "sack_revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack_cards[2]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Stage 3: sack card 3 is revealed. Revealed so far, in sack order: {sack_revealed}. Standing bid {standing_bid}, leader seat {leader_seat}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "stage 3",
      "label": "stage 3 bid",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not sack_done and stage == 3"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.in_auction and you.mice >= standing_bid + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": 0,
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.mice"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "text": "Stage 3. Revealed so far: {sack_revealed}. Standing bid {standing_bid}, leader seat {leader_seat}. Write 0 to pass, or bid a whole number from the standing bid + 1 up to your mice. Any number at or below the standing bid counts as a pass."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stage 3",
      "label": "resolve stage 3",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not sack_done and stage == 3"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.bid < standing_bid + 1 or you.bid > you.mice"
            },
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.seat != leader_seat"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pass_reward_stage_3"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) == 0"
            },
            "text": "Everyone still in passed at stage 3: seat {leader_seat} takes the sack at {standing_bid} with no reward; every other passer gains {pass_reward_stage_3} mice."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.bid == 0"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pass_reward_stage_3"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.in_auction and you.bid == 0"
            },
            "key": "in_auction",
            "value": false,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "standing_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid for p in players])"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "([p.seat for p in players if p.seat > start_seat and p.bid == standing_bid] + [p.seat for p in players if p.seat <= start_seat and p.bid == standing_bid])[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid > 0 for p in players) > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_auction for p in players) == 1 and not sack_done"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": true,
            "if": {
              "calc": "count(p.in_auction for p in players) == 1 and not sack_done"
            },
            "text": "Only one player is still in: seat {leader_seat} wins the sack at {standing_bid}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "stage_report",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[[p.seat, p.bid, p.mice] for p in players]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Stage 3 result [seat, bid (0 = pass), mice now]: {stage_report}. Standing bid {standing_bid}; leader seat {leader_seat}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "stage 3",
      "label": "the leader takes the sack after stage 3",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not sack_done"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "leader_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.bid >= 1 and you.seat != leader_seat"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "stage_3_outbid_bonus"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} bid at stage 3 but was outbid and gains {stage_3_outbid_bonus} mice."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_done",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "After stage 3, seat {sack_winner} leads and wins the sack at {standing_bid}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "open",
      "label": "open the sack",
      "when": {
        "calc": "sack_winner != 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack_cards"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_cat_values",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[(cat_value_1 if c == 'cat_-8' else (cat_value_2 if c == 'cat_-5' else (cat_value_3 if c == 'cat_3' else (cat_value_4 if c == 'cat_5' else (cat_value_5 if c == 'cat_8' else (cat_value_6 if c == 'cat_11' else cat_value_7)))))) for c in sack_cards if c in ['cat_-8', 'cat_-5', 'cat_3', 'cat_5', 'cat_8', 'cat_11', 'cat_15']]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sack_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum(sack_cat_values) + rabbit_value * count(c == 'rabbit' for c in sack_cards) - (max(sack_cat_values) if len(sack_cat_values) > 0 and 'large_dog' in sack_cards and 'small_dog' not in sack_cards else 0) - (min(sack_cat_values) if len(sack_cat_values) > 0 and 'small_dog' in sack_cards and 'large_dog' not in sack_cards else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "sack_winner"
            },
            "key": "mice",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-standing_bid"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "players[sack_winner - 1].mice >= standing_bid"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "sack_winner"
            },
            "key": "cat_points",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack_value"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard_pile",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard_pile + [[p.seat, p.played_card] for p in players]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The sack is opened. Cards in sack order (owners {sack_owners}): {sack_revealed}. After the dog rule the cats are worth {sack_value}. Seat {sack_winner} pays {standing_bid} mice and adds {sack_value} to their cat points. The cards are discarded face up."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "next",
      "label": "next start player",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "start_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sack_winner if sack_winner != 0 else (start_seat % len(players)) + 1"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {start_seat} is the start player for the next round."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "next",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_number >= rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "(you.cat_points + you.mice) * 1000 + you.cat_points",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final [seat, score (cat points + mice), cat points]: {[[p.seat, p.cat_points + p.mice, p.cat_points] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 9,
    "rounds_max": 10,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "SETUP. Each player gets an identical hand of {hand_size_dealt} cards: {cats_per_hand} cats worth {cat_value_1}, {cat_value_2}, {cat_value_3}, {cat_value_4}, {cat_value_5}, {cat_value_6} and {cat_value_7}; a rabbit worth {rabbit_value}; a large dog; and a small dog (card codes cat_-8, cat_-5, cat_3, cat_5, cat_8, cat_11, cat_15, rabbit, large_dog, small_dog). One random card is removed from each hand and set aside unseen by everyone, so each player keeps {hand_size_kept} cards in a private hand. Each player starts with {starting_mice} mice and {starting_cat_points} cat points; both are public throughout. Seats are in a fixed order. A random player is the first start player.\n\nEACH ROUND ({rounds} rounds; every player plays exactly one card per round, so every hand is empty after round {rounds}).\n\n1. Fill the sack and talk. Each player writes one short message (at most {message_max_words} words); messages are free text, may claim anything and are not enforced. All players, at the same moment, choose one card from their hand and place it face down; the card leaves their hand.\n\n2. Lay out the sack. The sack is laid out in seat order beginning with the start player: sack card 1 is the start player's card, card 2 belongs to the next player in seat order, and so on. Everyone knows whose card is in each position; only the owner knows its face. All messages are now shown to everyone, labelled with each writer's seat.\n\n3. Stage 1. Sack card 1 is revealed to all. The standing bid is {initial_standing_bid} and there is no leader. All players, at the same moment, write a whole number. 0 means pass; anything else is a bid. A bid must be at least the standing bid + 1 and at most the player's current mice. An illegal number counts as a pass.\n\n4. Resolve the stage, after every stage, in this order:\n a. Announce: every bidder's number (bid, or 0 for a pass) is shown to all by seat.\n b. All passed at stage 1: if every player passed, every player gains {all_pass_stage_1_reward} mice, nobody takes the sack, and it is discarded without being opened. Go to step 9.\n c. All passed at stage 2 or 3: if every player still in passed, the leader from the previous stage takes the sack at the standing bid and gains no reward. Every other player who passed at this stage gains the reward for this stage. Go to step 7.\n d. Otherwise: each player who passed at this stage leaves the auction for the round and gains mice from the bank: {pass_reward_stage_1} at stage 1, {pass_reward_stage_2} at stage 2, {pass_reward_stage_3} at stage 3. Players who bid stay in and gain nothing yet. The standing bid becomes the highest bid made at this stage, and the player who made it is the leader. If several players made the highest bid, the leader is the first of them in seat order, counting from the player after the start player, with the start player counted last. The new standing bid, the leader and every player's mice are announced.\n e. Immediate win: if exactly one player is still in, that player wins the sack at the standing bid just set. Skip the remaining stages and go to step 7. If two or more are still in, the auction continues.\n\n5. Stage 2. Played only if two or more players are still in. Sack card 2 is revealed. The players still in, at the same moment, pass (0) or bid between the standing bid + 1 and their current mice. An illegal number is a pass. Resolve as in step 4. A player who has left the auction is not asked.\n\n6. Stage 3. Played only if two or more players are still in. Sack card 3 is revealed. The players still in, at the same moment, pass or bid under the same rules. Resolve as in step 4. Then, if two or more players are still in, the leader wins the sack at the standing bid, and each player who bid at stage 3 but is not the leader gains {stage_3_outbid_bonus} mice.\n\n7. Open the sack. All sack cards are revealed; with 4 or 5 players, cards 4 and 5 are seen for the first time. Dog rule: if exactly one dog is in the sack, it removes one cat: the large dog removes the highest-valued cat; the small dog removes the lowest-valued cat. If no cat is present, nothing is removed. If both dogs are present, neither has any effect. All dogs and any removed cat are discarded.\n\n8. Pay and score. The sack winner pays their winning bid in mice to the bank. The sack winner adds the total value of the cats remaining in the sack to their cat points. Cat points may go negative. The rabbit is worth {rabbit_value}. The sack cards are discarded face up with their owners, so everyone can see which cards each player has used.\n\n9. Next start player. If someone took the sack, the sack winner becomes the start player. If nobody took the sack, the start player passes to the next seat.\n\nEND. After round {rounds}, each player's score is cat points + mice. The player with the highest score wins. If several players tie, the tied player with the most cat points wins. If they are still tied, the game is a draw among them and they share the win."
}
